### Current reconciliation report
GET {{host}}/api/v1/portfolios/2/investment/reconciliation
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{password}}

### Generate Yahoo export
GET {{host}}/api/v1/portfolios/2/investment/export/generate
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{password}}

### Upload first IBKR transaction range (POST requires ROLE_ADMIN)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/portfolios/2/investment/imports/broker/ibkr
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{password}}

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="U90000001.TRANSACTIONS.20250211.20251231.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../../main/resources/U90000001.TRANSACTIONS.20250211.20251231.csv
--WebAppBoundary--

### Upload second IBKR transaction range (POST requires ROLE_ADMIN)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/portfolios/2/investment/imports/broker/ibkr
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{password}}

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="U90000001.TRANSACTIONS.20260101.20260731.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../../main/resources/U90000001.TRANSACTIONS.20260101.20260731.csv
--WebAppBoundary--
